# Library packages do not pin a root Manifest, but the docs and experiment
# environments DO commit theirs — that is what makes results reproducible
# (see docs/src/design/09-implementation-roadmap.md, "Version Pinning").
/Manifest.toml
!/docs/Manifest.toml
!/experiments/**/Manifest.toml
/docs/build/
/docs/site/
*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
/experiments/**/results/
/experiments/**/*.jld2
/experiments/**/*.arrow
/paper/paper.pdf
/paper/jats/
*.log
